# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify rewrites.
#
# dist/index.html carries the landing page's content in its HTML (for
# readers that do not run scripts), and it is also what the host serves for
# every unknown path. The two dynamic app routes would show that content for
# the moment the bundle takes to load, so they are served the plain shell
# instead. /, /templates and /templates/<id> are real files with their own
# content; /app, /tracker and /r have their own content-free shells.
/resume/*  /shell.html  200
/print/*   /shell.html  200
